:""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""},{"verse":"22","text":""}]},{"chapter":"11","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""}]},{"chapter":"12","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":"Then Iyyov raised his voice and said:"},{"verse":"2","text":"True, you are the people [and its princes] and wisdom will perish with you."},{"verse":"3","text":"[But] I, too, have a heart as you do. I am not lesser than you; and who does not [know these things just] as these [i.e., just as you do]?"},{"verse":"4","text":"I am [one] who has become a laughingstock to his friend, and calls out to G d, who answers him [(that in return for this He will give him)] the true laughter of the righteous one."},{"verse":"5","text":"[(And I also know, just as you, that)] the torch of [the] shame [of Gehinnom awaits] him who is at ease in [his] thoughts, [saying: \"I shall be at peace,\" and that] he is prepared [to join the ranks of] \"those whose foot slips.\""},{"verse":"6","text":"[(And I also know, just as you, that for many days [until their ultimate destruction])] the tents of robbers are at peace, and those who anger G d dwell secure, [and that with all] that G d has brought [to the evildoer, the \"hour\" plays into] his hand."},{"verse":"7","text":"Ask [even] the beasts and they will teach [these things to] you, and the birds of heaven will tell you."},{"verse":"8","text":"Or speak to the earth, and it will teach you; and the fish of the sea will tell you."},{"verse":"9","text":"Who would not know by all these that the hand of the L rd has wrought this?"},{"verse":"10","text":"That in His hand is the spirit of all living things and the spirit of all mortal flesh?"},{"verse":"11","text":"Will not the ear [which hears what He has wrought] not discern [the implications of these] words just as the palate tastes food?"},{"verse":"12","text":"There is wisdom in the old and understanding in the long-lived"},{"verse":"13","text":"[to know that] with Him is wisdom and strength; with Him is counsel and understanding."},{"verse":"14","text":"When He destroys, none can rebuild. When He imprisons a man, none can free him."},{"verse":"15","text":"When He holds back the waters, the land is dry; when He sends them forth [(as He did in the generation of Enosh, when He flooded a third of the world)], they overturn the earth."},{"verse":"16","text":"He is the source of strength and weakness. His is the strayer and the one who causes [men] to stray [i.e., the Satan]."},{"verse":"17","text":"He leads counselors into folly and makes judges foolish."},{"verse":"18","text":"He unties the bonds of kings [e.g., Nevuchadnezzar] just as He buckles the belt on their thighs [(to \"gird\" them into kingship)]."},{"verse":"19","text":"He leads princes away with folly and twists the mighty."},{"verse":"20","text":"He [sometimes] removes speech [even] from the faithful [(viz., e.g., Genesis 15:6, followed by 8] and takes the acumen of the elders."},{"verse":"21","text":"He spills contempt upon the lordly and loosens the buckler of the mighty."},{"verse":"22","text":"He reveals [to man] what is profounder than darkness and brings shadows to light."},{"verse":"23","text":"He raises nations and destroys them [(through their pride)], spreads nations out [(over the earth)] and leads them [(into exile)]."},{"verse":"24","text":"He removes the wisdom of the leaders of the people, and they lead them into a void that is not a path."},{"verse":"25","text":"They feel in the darkness and not in light and He leads them astray as drunkards."}]},{"chapter":"13","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""},{"verse":"22","text":""},{"verse":"23","text":""},{"verse":"24","text":""},{"verse":"25","text":""},{"verse":"26","text":""},{"verse":"27","text":""},{"verse":"28","text":""}]},{"chapter":"14","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""},{"verse":"22","text":""}]},{"chapter":"15","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""},{"verse":"22","text":""},{"verse":"23","text":""},{"verse":"24","text